sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Source/Op
    participant Store as StreamStore
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant C as Consumer Op

    S->>Store: Set(stream, value)
    Store-->>S: seq
    S->>Bus: Publish(stream, seq)
    Bus->>D: Event(stream, seq)
    D->>C: Run()
    C->>Store: Get(inputs)
    C->>Store: Set(outputs)
    C->>Bus: Publish(output events)
